WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.540
<v Mike>StarTropics, Tropical Adventure of Epic Dimensions.

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:27.980
<v Mike>And welcome to NEStalgia, a chronological exploration of every NES game released in North America.

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:29.160
<v Hosts>I'm Mike.

