00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:48.400
<v Sean>Like a pitcher plant?

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:51.020
<v Joe>Like a pitcher, like a baseball pitcher.

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:57.440
<v Sean>Oh, I mean, I would have said something along the lines of like, very fertile soil.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.200
<v Sean>Yeah, that too. If you were talking about the plant.

