<v Joe>So you need something that like you can throw that'll come back to you.

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:26.920
<v Joe>Like I get where they were trying to go, but you know, I don't know if exactly translates.

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:29.480
<v Sean>I guess what was he supposed to be doing?

00:01:29.740 --> 00:01:31.380
<v Sean>Like he didn't even have any luggage on him.

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:32.740
<v Sean>Was he like going on vacation?

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:33.920
<v Sean>I didn't really quite.

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:48.020
<v Mike>Well, I have a question about that, Sean, because I was going to ask this and I don't think it's this, but the way that the game starts, you could argue that Star Tropics is one of those very popular isekais right now.

00:01:48.020 --> 00:01:56.880
