00:01:57.140 --> 00:01:58.760
<v Sean>So this is Ready Player One?

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:01.600
<v Mike>Yeah. Well, it's like a whole genre now.

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:05.520
<v Mike>It's got its own like Wikipedia page and everything.

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:09.980
<v Mike>But like, we don't really know a lot about Mike before the game starts.

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:16.320
<v Mike>And I guess he just like his uncle lived here, his alleged uncle.

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:18.220
<v Mike>And so you could just assume that he lived here.

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:21.920
<v Mike>But like, why does he start on what looked like a helicopter pad?

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:26.740
