00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:40.100
<v Sean>Yeah. I think that first of all, the whole his name being Mike thing kind of threw me for a loop because I had just gotten done name myself or I guess it naming the save.

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:41.380
<v Joe>Yeah. My own name.

00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:45.560
<v Sean>And then it's Mike. And I'm like, does Mike know the people that did this?

00:02:45.740 --> 00:02:48.220
<v Sean>Like, did you do this to me, Mike?

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:50.800
<v Mike>And I have an even better story than that.

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:57.700
<v Mike>I was playing on Nintendo Switch Online and with the NES package on there.

00:02:58.100 --> 00:03:02.620
<v Mike>And I named it because the character entry screen looks so much like the Legend of Zelda.

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:08.380
<v Mike>I was trying to be a little cheeky and name myself Link just to see if like they would do anything about it.

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:15.760
<v Mike>It still called you Mike. And it still called me Mike, but that freaked me out, Sean, because then I was like, wait a minute, is this like a Nintendo Switch Online thing where it knows my name?

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:17.640
<v Sean>Yeah, they're like, we know your name's Mike.

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:18.540
<v Joe>That link, asshole.

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:21.260
<v Mike>Right, right, right. So they just started calling me by my name.

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:24.220
<v Mike>It was very like, there's a moment in Doki Doki literature.

00:03:24.340 --> 00:03:26.840
<v Sean>I was going to say it, but that could be a spoiler.

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:30.900
<v Mike>It could be a spoiler, but come on, who's going to play that game if they haven't already?

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:35.720
<v Mike>That's true. That one listener who comments right now.

00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:37.440
<v Sean>Mmm, that's too bad.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:42.500
<v Mike>Yeah. And so reframing in a second, let's get away from Mike and the yo-yo.

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:46.760
<v Mike>Star Tropics is a top down action adventure game for the NES.

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:55.120
