<v Mike>I didn't figure this out until the end of the game.

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:17.280
<v Mike>And so I'm very sorry to say this, but the villain of the game is a guy named Zoda.

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:26.280
<v Mike>And I finally figured out that that was supposed to be soda in relation to the Cola naming convention of like the world and everything.

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:29.260
<v Mike>So I thought that was kind of cute in the long run.

00:04:30.260 --> 00:04:32.560
<v Sean>Wow. I didn't put that together.

00:04:32.780 --> 00:04:37.560
<v Sean>But yeah, I thought that it was just trying to be cute with food names.

