<v Joe>Yeah. I mean, it caught the Cola thing.

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:44.460
<v Joe>I mean, it's just like, it's trying to be...

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:46.100
<v Sean>Well, there's like Banan Girl.

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:47.920
<v Sean>Oh, I don't remember Banan Girl.

