01:19:35.240 --> 01:19:40.640
<v Mike>Uh, yeah, no, my pitch was just that, uh, we'll cover earth bound beginnings someday on

01:19:40.640 --> 01:19:43.380
<v Mike>our Patreon, which is patreon.com slash nostalgia.

01:19:43.700 --> 01:19:46.420
